@{
    Layout = "~/Views/XssLab/_Layout.cshtml";
    ViewBag.Title = "Overview";
}
<h2>Scanner test cases (CWE-79)</h2>
<p>Use a disposable browser profile without sensitive sessions. Only local requests can access these pages.</p>
<ul>
    <li>Reflected: query-string Value flows through MVC model binding to Html.Raw.</li>
    <li>Stored: form Value is written to App_Data/xss-lab.txt, read on subsequent requests, and rendered with Html.Raw.</li>
    <li>DOM-based: the URL fragment is decoded and assigned to innerHTML in Scripts/xss-lab.js.</li>
</ul>
<p>Paste this harmless demonstration payload into any test form:</p>
<pre>&lt;img src=x onerror=alert('xss-lab')&gt;</pre>
<p>The vulnerable output should display an alert. The encoded comparison should display literal text.</p>
<p>Stored input survives application restarts. Use Clear stored input on the stored page to remove it.</p>
